---

Welcome to my new corner of the internet. This site is a statically-typed Astro
app served from the home server, with [Keystatic](https://keystatic.com) running
as the CMS.

## How it works

Posts live in a git repository at
[waynevanson/blog](https://github.com/waynevanson/blog). Keystatic runs in GitHub
mode: signing in through the admin UI lets you edit entries, and saving commits
them straight to the repository.

The server keeps a shallow checkout of that repository and reads content from it
at request time, so publishing a post makes it live without a rebuild.

- Content: `content/posts/*.mdoc`
- Admin: [`/keystatic`](/keystatic)
- Feed: [`/rss.xml`](/rss.xml)

```mdoc
---
title: Hello, world
description: A first post.
publishedAt: 2026-11-12
draft: false
---

Welcome to my new corner of the internet.
```

More to come.
